//
// Edit wording here; no code changes needed. Save the file and
// refresh /present in the browser: the page reads this file each
// time it opens, so Isa does NOT need a restart (and must not be
// restarted mid-talk: ticket numbers would start again at TKT-0001).
//
// Rules for the wording:
