// - The demo runs from one sign-in: Watanabe Kenji, day 3 (July 3, 2026).
//   Run python onboarding\prepare_demo.py before each rehearsal.
//
// Each slide has a "kind" that decides its layout:
//   landing, cover, problem, statement, rules, safetynet, pipeline, status, showwork, list,
//   demo, numbered, features, promises, closing.
// "section" is the small label above the title.
// On a "promises" slide each item has "title" (the promise), "text" (its
// detail, optional), "built" and "status": built, partial, designed, plan or reword.
// "presenter" shows in the corner, so hand-offs are clear.
// In "lead", a word between *asterisks* is shown in italics and colour.
// On a "problem" slide, \n in "lead" starts a new line.
// Lines starting with // are comments and are ignored.
// ============================================================
